attle from Brick Mayhem!The Necromancer has gathered an army of zombies, but our heroes have one trick left—a barrel full of gunpowder.The demo is coming together nicely, and I'm looking forward to sharing it with everyone during Steam Next Fest.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T16:10:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345502","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4759420-1839041357033443","game_id":"steam-4759420","kind":"announcement","title":"Brick Mayhem Devlog #3 — Huge Progress! New Save System, Map & Gameplay","summary":"In this development update I'm showing the latest progress on Brick Mayhem! This video includes: A prototype of the new world map The first version of the save system New gameplay mechanics and improvements Various quality-of-life changes One of the biggest changes is the new save system. The entire game state is now stored in a single save file, making it much easier to save, load and expand the game as development continues. There is still a lot of work ahead, but Brick Mayhem is getting close","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T09:17:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357033443","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4759420-1836506165553524","game_id":"steam-4759420","kind":"announcement","title":"Also From Tetrapunk Design","summary":"Squares of Hell is a dark and atmospheric puzzle adventure where lost souls face unusual trials on their journey toward peace.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T11:01:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/18